    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Map pinning (persistence)",
      "source_hash": 17314648893339302743,
      "context_hash": 5960290872170638425,
      "translation": "맵 고정(영속화)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:51:08.470673Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "By default, a map lives as long as its file descriptor is open.",
      "source_hash": 14140714756863389794,
      "context_hash": 921810982502126625,
      "translation": "기본적으로 맵은 파일 디스크립터가 열려 있는 동안만 유지됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "file descriptor": "파일 디스크립터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:51:08.470673Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Pin it to `/sys/fs/bpf/` to make it survive process exit:",
      "source_hash": 6264408172051207868,
      "context_hash": 16398077784165107029,
      "translation": "프로세스가 종료된 후에도 유지되게 하려면 `/sys/fs/bpf/`에 고정(pin)하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "process": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:51:08.470673Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Map limits and memory",
      "source_hash": 16115712607677222676,
      "context_hash": 8272669494978226748,
      "translation": "맵 제한과 메모리",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:51:08.470673Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Memory accounting: maps are charged to `memlock` rlimit of the creating process (unless `BPF_F_MMAPABLE` or newer accounting).",
      "source_hash": 7454089333863574818,
      "context_hash": 8423818762169537036,
      "translation": "메모리 어카운팅: 맵은 생성한 프로세스의 `memlock` rlimit에 부과됩니다(`BPF_F_MMAPABLE` 또는 더 새로운 어카운팅 방식을 쓰는 경우는 제외).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "accounting": "어카운팅",
        "memory": "메모리",
        "process": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:51:08.470674Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Atomic operations in maps",
      "source_hash": 174301643373481177,
      "context_hash": 1066611245210001249,
      "translation": "맵에서의 원자적 연산",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:51:08.470674Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "For per-CPU-free atomic updates in hash/array maps:",
      "source_hash": 12386937796358723924,
      "context_hash": 11124502991845689428,
      "translation": "해시/배열 맵에서 per-CPU 없이 원자적으로 갱신하려면 다음과 같이 합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "array": "배열"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:51:08.470674Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "For high-frequency counters, prefer `BPF_MAP_TYPE_PERCPU_ARRAY` to avoid atomics entirely.",
      "source_hash": 2426561831304488213,
      "context_hash": 1703950109102426728,
      "translation": "빈도가 높은 카운터에는 원자적 연산을 아예 피할 수 있도록 `BPF_MAP_TYPE_PERCPU_ARRAY`를 사용하는 것이 좋습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:51:08.470674Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
